[BODY] link_buyer_identity returns 200; link_result.buyer_id equals the Platform user's platform_id for @td(ACME_ADMIN.email); link_result.organization_id equals @td(ORG_ACME.platform_id) {SPEC}
[MATH] the storefront cart Subtotal = first_product.price × 1 {BL} -- UCP prices are in MINOR units: compare first_product.price.amount / 100 (or price.formatted_amount) with the storefront Subtotal to 2 decimal places
[MATH] cart.totals.total.amount = cart.totals.subtotal.amount + tax_total.amount + shipping_total.amount + payment_total.amount + fee_total.amount - discount_total.amount (all from the create_cart response) {BL} -- exact, not a floor: total is tax-inclusive (BL-CHK-006; 20% tax on vcptcore-regression, none on vcst), and an amount leaking into the total fails here
[BODY] handoff.checkout.id equals cart.id {SPEC}
[NAV] browser URL matches /cart/{cart.id}\?ucp_handoff=1 after opening continue_url {OBSERVED}
[REL] the storefront cart's NON-GIFT line items and total equal cart.id / cart.total captured from the MCP leg {SPEC} -- a store promotion may add a $0 gift line (isGift=true): MCP line_items omit it, the storefront shows it in a separate gift block, and Admin items[] includes it; it does not change totals
[DOM] after leaving the /cart checkout layout (it shows no organization name; e.g. click the logo) the storefront header shows the organization of @td(ORG_ACME.platform_id) — org-scoped, not anonymous {OBSERVED} -- the [ADMIN] organizationId check in Cross_Layer_Checks is the authoritative proof of org context

